WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:02.285
(energetic music ending)

00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:03.118
- Wow.

00:00:03.118 --> 00:00:03.951
From bald to Bald.

00:00:03.951 --> 00:00:04.784
Did you see that?

00:00:04.784 --> 00:00:05.714
Welcome back.

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:07.500
Sometimes Kelly saves her favorite stories

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:10.830
for the end of the show and she calls it,

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.429
This is What I'm Liking.

00:00:13.429 --> 00:00:16.440
(energetic instrumental break)

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:18.237
Now, (inarticulate speaking)

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:20.850
I'm gonna go off script here.

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.890
I love being on the internet

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:24.930
because I feel like when
I'm on the internet,

00:00:24.930 --> 00:00:27.000
I discover new things

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:29.580
and nothing makes me more excited

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:31.680
than watching people on the internet

00:00:31.680 --> 00:00:34.050
discover new things.

00:00:34.050 --> 00:00:36.690
And this young lady in Illinois

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:39.390
had her kids discovering a brand new thing

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.130
which just makes you feel like

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:42.330
they're discovering new things,

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.880
at the same time, makes me feel old.

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:46.170
Uh, watch this.

00:00:46.170 --> 00:00:48.360
- Yo, it's actually working!

00:00:48.360 --> 00:00:50.160
- [Mom] Yeah, it's hooked.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:52.020
It's a, it's a phone.

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:53.490
- Can I do your number?

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:54.810
- [Mom] Yeah. You, you.

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:55.643
It will ring.

00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:56.476
It will call me.

00:00:56.476 --> 00:00:57.309
- [Older child] Really?
All right, hold up.

00:00:57.309 --> 00:00:58.800
- [Mom] Yeah. It's a real phone!

00:00:58.800 --> 00:00:59.850
- What I do now?

00:00:59.850 --> 00:01:01.980
- [Mom] Put it up to your ear.

00:01:01.980 --> 00:01:02.813
See?

00:01:04.230 --> 00:01:05.063
- Answer, answer!

00:01:05.063 --> 00:01:05.896
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.059
The phone actually works!

00:01:09.059 --> 00:01:10.181
(older child laughing)

00:01:10.181 --> 00:01:11.727
(crowd clapping and cheering)

00:01:11.727 --> 00:01:13.230
- How adorable is that?

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.460
That's so amazing.

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:15.293
It works!

00:01:15.293 --> 00:01:17.100
You can hear things and there's numbers.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.600
The girls, Madison and Hayden

00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:21.210
are on the line along
with their mother, Leah.

00:01:21.210 --> 00:01:22.398
Hi Leah.

00:01:22.398 --> 00:01:23.971
(crowd cheering and clapping)

00:01:23.971 --> 00:01:25.290
- Hi, Howie.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:26.580
- [Howie] What did you like,

00:01:26.580 --> 00:01:28.260
did you know they
wouldn't know what it was?

00:01:28.260 --> 00:01:32.040
Or did they go to the wall
and say, what is this?

00:01:32.040 --> 00:01:33.960
- Well, they've seen the phone before

00:01:33.960 --> 00:01:36.030
but they had never seen one that works.

00:01:36.030 --> 00:01:38.040
So they were super excited
that it was actually

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.870
like they could hear the dial tone.

00:01:39.870 --> 00:01:41.700
- [Howie] And young
ladies, were you amazed

00:01:41.700 --> 00:01:43.530
when you heard a voice coming through

00:01:43.530 --> 00:01:46.256
that thing that you were
holding to your ear?

00:01:46.256 --> 00:01:47.089
- Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:01:47.089 --> 00:01:48.630
- Yeah, It's amazing.

00:01:48.630 --> 00:01:49.920
What will they think of next?

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:52.230
Now that you experienced a landline,

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:54.270
do you have any questions, Madison?

00:01:54.270 --> 00:01:56.760
- Well, if you're not around

00:01:56.760 --> 00:01:57.593
- [Howie] Right.

00:01:57.593 --> 00:01:59.083
- the landline like how would

00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:00.360
you know if someone called you?

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:04.170
- Okay. So the answer to that is sometimes

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:06.900
like say you go out, say you go to school,

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:08.460
your mom is at home.

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.063
So when you get home, your mom
will say somebody called you.

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:15.232
You see how that works?

00:02:15.232 --> 00:02:16.065
- Yeah.

00:02:16.065 --> 00:02:18.900
- [Howie] Does that answer,
are there any more questions?

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:20.640
I have a question.

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:21.870
Where did your teeth go?

00:02:21.870 --> 00:02:23.310
- Yeah.

00:02:23.310 --> 00:02:24.613
- [Howie] Where did your teeth go?

00:02:24.613 --> 00:02:26.040
(laughing)

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.600
You are so adorable.

00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:29.850
You really are adorable.

00:02:29.850 --> 00:02:31.980
I love that. You're all adorable.

00:02:31.980 --> 00:02:32.880
You're beautiful.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:34.140
Thank you so much.

00:02:34.140 --> 00:02:37.470
I am liking your post right now.

00:02:37.470 --> 00:02:39.750
Thanks for being part of this show.

00:02:39.750 --> 00:02:41.190
But wait, there's more.

00:02:41.190 --> 00:02:44.550
Our season long partner
Pilot Pen, makers of G2,

00:02:44.550 --> 00:02:46.530
the go-to pen of Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:02:46.530 --> 00:02:50.310
wanna honor unstoppable,
curious people like yourselves.

00:02:50.310 --> 00:02:54.523
So they're giving you
one thousand dollars!

00:02:54.523 --> 00:02:55.725
(crowd cheering)

00:02:55.725 --> 00:02:56.558
- What?

00:02:59.880 --> 00:03:01.140
- They'll be phoning you
- [Mom] Thank you so much!

00:03:01.140 --> 00:03:02.820
and letting you know when it'll get there.

00:03:02.820 --> 00:03:04.230
So stay by the phone.

00:03:04.230 --> 00:03:06.180
Thanks to all our guests this hour.

00:03:06.180 --> 00:03:08.880
Terry Cruz, my daughter, Jackie Schultz.

00:03:08.880 --> 00:03:11.220
Olivia and Emily Kaufman.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:12.990
Like Kelly says, have a great day

00:03:12.990 --> 00:03:15.480
and if it's not, just change it.

00:03:15.480 --> 00:03:16.728
Thank you everybody.

